Package: goodhaptic
Architecture: linux-any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 libgtk-4-1,
 libadwaita-1-0,
Description: Touchpad haptic feedback control tool
 Good Haptic is a GTK4/Libadwaita application for controlling
 Goodix GXTP5100 touchpad haptic feedback strength.
 .
 Features:
  - Auto-detection of hidraw haptic devices
  - Preset strength levels and stepless slider control
  - System service for boot-time strength restoration
  - Per-session password authentication
